{"spread": 24, "blocks": [[{"t": "N", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 112.9, "color": "#9BD9E5", "bbox": [53, 21, 128, 175]}], [{"t": "uno Rio Tinto did not ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [128, 61, 231, 75]}, {"t": "come to Mint to keep ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [128, 73, 234, 87]}, {"t": "the lights on. He came ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [128, 85, 238, 99]}, {"t": "to switch on a market. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [128, 97, 238, 111]}, {"t": "Bangkok was not a ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [128, 109, 221, 123]}, {"t": "lightning bolt. \u201cThere ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [128, 121, 233, 135]}, {"t": "wasn\u2019t a single moment, ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [128, 133, 247, 147]}, {"t": "more like a slow hum that got louder,\u201d ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [62, 145, 246, 159]}, {"t": "he says.  He wanted warmth, a little ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [62, 157, 234, 171]}, {"t": "chaos, creative energy. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [62, 169, 177, 183]}], [{"t": "Central Embassy in Phloen Chit became ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [62, 193, 255, 207]}, {"t": "his unofficial base: breakfasts, lunches, ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [62, 205, 254, 219]}, {"t": "coffees, conversations that started ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [62, 217, 236, 231]}, {"t": "casual and ended with next steps.\n", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [62, 229, 231, 243]}, {"t": "\n", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [62, 241, 65, 255]}, {"t": "Nuno arrived with more than a decade ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [62, 253, 249, 267]}, {"t": "across business development, strategy ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [62, 265, 255, 279]}, {"t": "and operations, including leading Swift ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [62, 277, 253, 291]}, {"t": "Property Maintenance in the UK. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [62, 289, 221, 303]}], [{"t": "That mix now focuses on Thailand. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [62, 313, 231, 327]}, {"t": "Spot the right opportunities. Shape ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [62, 325, 237, 339]}, {"t": "clear scopes. Keep programmes ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [62, 337, 218, 351]}, {"t": "realistic. Build teams that actually do ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [62, 349, 245, 363]}, {"t": "what they say.\n", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [62, 361, 136, 375]}, {"t": "\n", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [62, 373, 65, 387]}, {"t": "The first proof point came quickly with ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [62, 385, 253, 399]}, {"t": "the YETI APAC workplace. Tight brief, ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [62, 397, 240, 411]}, {"t": "tighter timeline. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [62, 409, 142, 423]}], [{"t": "Fourteen weeks from start to ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [275, 61, 419, 75]}, {"t": "handover. Early alignment on site, clear ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [275, 73, 466, 87]}, {"t": "lead times from suppliers, and M&E ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [275, 85, 445, 99]}, {"t": "decisions shaped by how things are ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [275, 97, 451, 111]}, {"t": "really built, not just how they look on a ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [275, 109, 465, 123]}, {"t": "drawing. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [275, 121, 318, 135]}], [{"t": "The result was a clean handover and ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [275, 145, 453, 159]}, {"t": "a project that says to future clients, ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [275, 157, 453, 171]}, {"t": "\u201cThis is what you can expect.\u201d\n", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [275, 169, 424, 183]}, {"t": "\n", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [275, 181, 278, 195]}, {"t": "Ask him what a \u201cright project\u201d feels like ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [275, 193, 466, 207]}, {"t": "and he talks about energy, not scale. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [275, 205, 456, 219]}, {"t": "\u201cThe challenges feel exciting, not ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [275, 217, 439, 231]}, {"t": "exhausting,\u201d he says. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [275, 229, 380, 243]}], [{"t": "You can see where your effort matters. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [275, 253, 464, 267]}, {"t": "That feeling is now a filter. Bid where ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [275, 265, 455, 279]}, {"t": "the programme can stay honest, where ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [275, 277, 467, 291]}, {"t": "long-lead items can be locked in early, ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [275, 289, 463, 303]}, {"t": "where people prefer fewer surprises ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [275, 301, 452, 315]}, {"t": "and clearer choices.\n", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [275, 313, 374, 327]}, {"t": "\n", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [275, 325, 278, 339]}, {"t": "Outside of work, small rituals keep the ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [275, 337, 461, 351]}, {"t": "pace grounded. Port FC matches. Solo ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [275, 349, 461, 363]}, {"t": "coffees to think about what he can ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [275, 361, 448, 375]}, {"t": "improve. Early gym sessions so the day ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [275, 373, 466, 387]}, {"t": "does not set the terms. From the UK he ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [275, 385, 466, 399]}, {"t": "keeps two rules close: listen first, and ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [275, 397, 459, 411]}, {"t": "if you say you will do something, do it. ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Regular", "size": 10.0, "color": "#030405", "bbox": [275, 409, 462, 423]}]]}